{% set layout = 'side' %}

= Sketch with the mouse

* Draw in the frame with the mouse
* Keys of the demo: Z undo, C clear, 1 2 3 colors, D draw or turn the camera
* The arrow keys still change the slide

<div class="controls">
<p>
<button data-demo-set="color=black">Black</button>
<button data-demo-set="color=red">Red</button>
<button data-demo-set="color=blue">Blue</button>
<button data-demo-set="undo">Undo</button>
<button data-demo-set="clear">Clear</button>
</p>
<p>Strokes: <span class="value" data-demo-value="strokes"></span></p>
</div>

